        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ribbon of painted silk taffeta and cut work. White taffeta ground wit a zig-zag pattern in which one element is delicately painted with a floral pattern and the other is punched with a filling like lace. Each one of these differs slightly. The cut areas appear first to have been painted with a light glue and the centre cut out. A piece of net has then been applied to the back and painted with white paint to simulate lace."@en ;
